GAMIKO ASSETS & COLLABORATION LICENSE
Version 1.0 | Effective Date: 2026-01-28

1. OWNERSHIP AND COPYRIGHT
All creative assets (including but not limited to images, illustrations, 
story scripts, dialogue, and audio files) uploaded to this repository 
remain the exclusive property of the original contributor (the "Owner"). 
In the case of a Pull Request (PR), the "Owner" refers to the individual 
or entity who submitted the PR.

2. GRANT OF LICENSE TO GAMIKO
By submitting content to this repository, the Owner irrevocably grants 
the Gamiko platform a non-exclusive, worldwide, sublicensable license 
(solely for the purpose of operating the platform) to use, display, 
reproduce, and distribute the submitted assets in connection with the 
Gamiko application and its official versions across all platforms 
(iOS, Android, Web, etc.). This license is revenue-sharing eligible.

3. SELECTION AND USAGE
Gamiko reserves the unconditional right, at its sole discretion, to 
decide whether to include, use, or continue using any submitted assets. 
Submission of an asset does not create any obligation for Gamiko to 
utilize the asset, nor does it guarantee inclusion in the live application.

4. REVENUE SHARING
If an asset is selected and used within the Gamiko platform, the Owner 
shall be eligible for potential revenue sharing. The specific sharing 
amount will be automatically calculated by the system's internal 
algorithm, with such algorithm subject to Gamiko’s sole discretion; 
all distribution rules are subject to Gamiko's sole discretion and 
may be adjusted and updated from time to time to ensure fairness 
and adapt to the platform's growth.

5. RESTRICTIONS ON THIRD PARTIES
Except for the explicit license granted to Gamiko herein, no rights, 
titles, or interests in or to the assets are granted to any third party. 
Any unauthorized use, reproduction, modification, or commercial 
exploitation of the assets in this repository by third parties is 
strictly prohibited and protected under applicable international 
copyright laws and treaties.

6. NO OTHER WARRANTIES
All assets are provided on an "as is" basis, without any warranties of 
any kind, express or implied. Gamiko makes no guarantees regarding 
the amount of revenue generated, the final performance of the assets, 
or any other aspect of the assets’ use on the platform.GAMIKO ASSETS & COLLABORATION LICENSE
